{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/b8fb5b5a9b89fbe691aaefa9a4b49ae8.avif?t=1773671975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras_big/b8fb5b5a9b89fbe691aaefa9a4b49ae8.webp?t=1773671975 width=1560 height=355 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to test your friendships?\u00a0 Roombattle is a Vacuum-Party-Battler playable in solo or with up to six friends in both online and local multiplayer! Your goal? Popping all of your opponents\u2019 balloons with your trusty weapon.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the last vacuum cleaner surviving and claim victory in crazy battles with plenty of unique maps, minigames and game-modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roombattle is designed for all types of players and can be played with just 2 buttons and a stick. Don\u2019t have a controller? No problem, you can also play using a keyboard or smartphone as a controller!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call your friends, customize your vacuum, and get ready for some good old fashioned party gaming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/cf94dabdd5d0bcb9f1786a581e58f73c.avif?t=1773671975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras_big/cf94dabdd5d0bcb9f1786a581e58f73c.webp?t=1773671975 width=1560 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your friends in detailed and diverse rooms filled with interactivity, with dangers, traps and obstacles making every setting feel truly alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop a fish tank into the ground, crash into all the office supplies, or smash a 240-million-year-old dinosaur skeleton, all in the name of healthy competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn every map\u2019s unique quirks and be the master behind the chaos, taking advantage of the game\u2019s unique environments to ensure you\u2019re the last vacuum standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/38511db55c56ca3ee52c3fbd96dd2018.poster.avif?t=1773671975\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/38511db55c56ca3ee52c3fbd96dd2018.webm?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/38511db55c56ca3ee52c3fbd96dd2018.mp4?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/fbba1f47074cb09e673ba7cff26c7534.avif?t=1773671975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras_big/fbba1f47074cb09e673ba7cff26c7534.webp?t=1773671975 width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance, score goals, have a nice time in the pool or as any good vacuum does, clean your actual room.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4fc0763ffeb340e8b3143729dba19c0e.poster.avif?t=1773671975\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4fc0763ffeb340e8b3143729dba19c0e.webm?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4fc0763ffeb340e8b3143729dba19c0e.mp4?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4019a7879e1b1526cd643185fda1e8c1.avif?t=1773671975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras_big/4019a7879e1b1526cd643185fda1e8c1.webp?t=1773671975 width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want your vacuum cleaner to look like a pirate, unicorn, or kappa? How about a Viking with a magic wand? Pick your color, hat, eyes, and your favorite sharp object, ready to pop everyone else\u2019s balloons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match contributes to a full progression system, unlocking new gameplay elements and cosmetic rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly 200,000 customization combinations, players can personalize their vacuum to create their own distinctive cleaning machine, and the more you play, the more you unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4532d39925a2382d6b4084538e01cbb8.poster.avif?t=1773671975\" width=1170 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4532d39925a2382d6b4084538e01cbb8.webm?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4532d39925a2382d6b4084538e01cbb8.mp4?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3223000?t=1773671975","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3223000?t=1773671975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/edb5ec79e5036697cb5ddd2730e4f2999394af58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773671975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/edb5ec79e5036697cb5ddd2730e4f2999394af58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773671975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/b8fb5b5a9b89fbe691aaefa9a4b49ae8.avif?t=1773671975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras_big/b8fb5b5a9b89fbe691aaefa9a4b49ae8.webp?t=1773671975 width=1560 height=355 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to test your friendships?\u00a0 Roombattle is a Vacuum-Party-Battler playable in solo or with up to six friends in both online and local multiplayer! Your goal? Popping all of your opponents\u2019 balloons with your trusty weapon.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the last vacuum cleaner surviving and claim victory in crazy battles with plenty of unique maps, minigames and game-modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roombattle is designed for all types of players and can be played with just 2 buttons and a stick. Don\u2019t have a controller? No problem, you can also play using a keyboard or smartphone as a controller!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call your friends, customize your vacuum, and get ready for some good old fashioned party gaming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/cf94dabdd5d0bcb9f1786a581e58f73c.avif?t=1773671975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras_big/cf94dabdd5d0bcb9f1786a581e58f73c.webp?t=1773671975 width=1560 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your friends in detailed and diverse rooms filled with interactivity, with dangers, traps and obstacles making every setting feel truly alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop a fish tank into the ground, crash into all the office supplies, or smash a 240-million-year-old dinosaur skeleton, all in the name of healthy competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn every map\u2019s unique quirks and be the master behind the chaos, taking advantage of the game\u2019s unique environments to ensure you\u2019re the last vacuum standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/38511db55c56ca3ee52c3fbd96dd2018.poster.avif?t=1773671975\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/38511db55c56ca3ee52c3fbd96dd2018.webm?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/38511db55c56ca3ee52c3fbd96dd2018.mp4?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/fbba1f47074cb09e673ba7cff26c7534.avif?t=1773671975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras_big/fbba1f47074cb09e673ba7cff26c7534.webp?t=1773671975 width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance, score goals, have a nice time in the pool or as any good vacuum does, clean your actual room.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4fc0763ffeb340e8b3143729dba19c0e.poster.avif?t=1773671975\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4fc0763ffeb340e8b3143729dba19c0e.webm?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4fc0763ffeb340e8b3143729dba19c0e.mp4?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4019a7879e1b1526cd643185fda1e8c1.avif?t=1773671975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras_big/4019a7879e1b1526cd643185fda1e8c1.webp?t=1773671975 width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want your vacuum cleaner to look like a pirate, unicorn, or kappa? How about a Viking with a magic wand? Pick your color, hat, eyes, and your favorite sharp object, ready to pop everyone else\u2019s balloons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match contributes to a full progression system, unlocking new gameplay elements and cosmetic rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly 200,000 customization combinations, players can personalize their vacuum to create their own distinctive cleaning machine, and the more you play, the more you unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4532d39925a2382d6b4084538e01cbb8.poster.avif?t=1773671975\" width=1170 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4532d39925a2382d6b4084538e01cbb8.webm?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/extras/4532d39925a2382d6b4084538e01cbb8.mp4?t=1773671975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Dust Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223000/8786901cc09d0a3776e69a5b56d0f15bd1bc2502/header.jpg?t=1773671975","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Dust Games. All rights reserved. Roombattle and the Roombattle logo are trademarks of Dust Games.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 / Debian 11 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750-Ti / AMD RX 550, 2GB VRAM (Mesa 21.0+ or proprietary driver)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available